	(text "A/C CLUTCH  block 02.15 (b) - DNP: U12 P17 -> U14 BTT6050-1ERA high side, fed from V12C_RAW, out on DP-DCU-B 12" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 690 262 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "afb937f1-0b68-4823-8c20-79d9d4b3af09"))
	(text "Fed from the comfort input ahead of D3 (the B560C carries only the servo rail and mirror heat); the coil returns at the compressor body (engine ground)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 690 266.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62d6a5e9-5321-4af7-ab4b-a8a678dba3da"))
	(text "never through the DCU. F29 is 7.5 A for servo + mirror heat today: with a ~4 A coil it needs 10 A - confirm (V-101). The coil carries its own diode (EAS 60 mJ)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 690 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8bb2e9fe-1d85-4730-872f-b63da606a8af"))
