		(property "Note" "02.15 (b) only - DNP until engine block 02.15 answers; A/C clutch high side: IL(NOM) 4.5 A at 85 C against a ~4 A coil - confirm the coil current; a lower-RON PROFET if it is over 3.5 A; the coil must carry its own suppression diode (EAS 60 mJ) - confirm" (at 721.36 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (hide yes)))
