	(text "A/C PRESSURE  block 02.15 (b) - DNP: J11 transducer lead (0.5-4.5 V ratiometric, confirm) -> 10k / 20k -> U15 ADS1115-Q1 at 0x48; its 5 V from U16, which tracks +5V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 316 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa2e9042-c04d-4ea6-900f-ab07abfb4f22"))
	(text "No Teensy ADC pin is free (all 42 edge pins used, D-452), so the reading goes over I2C. AIN0 pressure, AIN2 the sensor supply (ratio = AIN0 / AIN2); AIN1 and AIN3 grounded, spare." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 320.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "54cc47ca-785e-4ceb-8247-19b763cdf84c"))
	(text "J11 is a PLACEHOLDER: 02.15 (b) gives the transducer's three wires no drop cavity (DP-DCU 1-6 used, DP-DCU-B 12 taken by the clutch) - confirm the harness path." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 324 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "54c19754-e759-4381-a9fb-82b0fd06ac9d"))
