	(text "RADAR ALERT  luxury 03.12 / Z-002 - DNP: J12 the receiver's alert lead -> 47k / 22k, 100n, BAT54S -> U13 P01; R68 wets an open-collector output" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 398 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b35ad904-b092-4da5-9d94-6b38ad432b7c"))
	(text "The receiver sits behind the dash on its own feed (N103, A16); its alert line is local, not on a drop. Output type unknown: active-high 12 V reads high through the divider;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 402.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02ed0a87-a8a3-4be4-b2cf-35bb0e87acbc"))
	(text "an open-collector output needs R68 fitted and reads low when it alerts. 12 V -> 3.8 V clamped by D11; 8 V still reads high (VIH 2.31 V at 3.3 V). J12 is a PLACEHOLDER - confirm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 406 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b8df1ed-ff7a-4d9f-99bf-d907529b7450"))
