	(text "DP-DCU-C 8 (J2 pin 8) is wired to PGND: block 01.26 (a), the third comfort ground (about 10 A per pin). The record keeps the cavity a sealing plug until 01.26 answers -" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 456 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56a04d73-45f6-42a1-a5e3-68db3ef478c4"))
	(text "the copper is there either way, the contact and its 14 AWG wire are fitted with the answer. DP-DCU-B 12 carries AC_CLUTCH (02.15 (b)); it stays a plug until then." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 460.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "92daa420-88f4-4574-8d9f-ac6692e68323"))
	(text "Every part in this box but U13 and C38 is DNP; each carries its reason in its Note field. Nothing here touches +12V_CMF; U14 and the GND / PGND rule (CONVENTIONS 5) hold." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 584 465 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2503ae10-2512-4f26-8d69-4b60a3465c00"))
